  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe [`fragment parsing algorithm steps`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dynamic-markup-insertion.html#fragment-parsing-algorithm-steps) take an Element or DocumentFragment but it seems like it's never passed a DocumentFragment?\r\n\r\nIf it ever were the algorithm is erroneous, as it calls the [HTML fragment parsing algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/parsing.html#html-fragment-parsing-algorithm) which only takes an Element.",
